    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "after_text",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Avonent combines five digestive enzymes to help break down protein, fats, carbohydrates, fiber, and lactose—plus artichoke, ox bile, slippery elm, and targeted botanicals for more complete digestive support.</p>"
